PHAN TICH VA NHAN XET CHUYEN SAU:
1. Fuzzer hop den co the tim ra loi neu tang ngan sach du lon VA CO TU DIEN (DICTIONARY) HO TRO:
   Nho tu dien co san cac token 'ADMIN:', 'X', fuzzer co xac suat tinh co ghep hai token nay lai voi nhau.
2. KHOANG CACH TRONG THUC TE CON LON HON GAP BOI:
   - Trong thuc te, cac nha nghien cuu bao mat hay ke tan cong khong co san mot tu dien hoan hao chua dung
     chinh xac cac chuoi ma hoa noi bo cua nha phat trien.
   - Khi chuong trinh phan tich cac giao thuc phuc tap (vi du: HTTP headers, TLS handshake, file PDF/PNG),
     khong gian dau vao la vo cung khong lo. Fuzzing hop den hoan toan 'chet chim' trong hang ty to hop vo nghia,
     trong khi coverage-guided fuzzing co the tu dong tai tao lai toan bo dinh dang file ma khong can doc tai lieu!